{"unit_id":"tag:06KM:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>上的光滑的（smooth）、可预表的（prorepresentable）函子中的群胚（groupoid in functors）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>我们称<MATH_0003>是<TEXTITOPEN_0001>规范化的（normalized）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，如果群胚（groupoid）<MATH_0004>是完全不连通的（totally disconnected），即不同对象（objects）之间没有态射（morphisms）。\n<STRUCT_0003>我们称<MATH_0005>是<TEXTITOPEN_0002>极小的（minimal）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，如果<MATH_0006>由<MATH_0007>的极小泛形式对象（minimal versal formal object）给出。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑的"},{"source_term":"prorepresentable","target_term":"可预表的"},{"source_term":"groupoid in functors","target_term":"函子中的群胚"},{"source_term":"normalized","target_term":"规范化的"},{"source_term":"groupoid","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"totally disconnected","target_term":"完全不连通的"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"minimal","target_term":"极小的"},{"source_term":"minimal versal formal object","target_term":"极小泛形式对象"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑的","context":"群胚性质，译法待决"},{"source_term":"prorepresentable","target_term":"可预表的","context":"群胚性质，译法待决"},{"source_term":"groupoid in functors","target_term":"函子中的群胚","context":"所给群胚，译法待决"},{"source_term":"normalized","target_term":"规范化的","context":"所定义群胚性质，译法待决"},{"source_term":"groupoid","target_term":"群胚","context":"所给群胚，译法待决"},{"source_term":"totally disconnected","target_term":"完全不连通的","context":"群胚性质，译法待决"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"群胚对象，译法待决"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"群胚态射，译法待决"},{"source_term":"minimal","target_term":"极小的","context":"所定义群胚性质，译法待决"},{"source_term":"minimal versal formal object","target_term":"极小泛形式对象","context":"所给形式对象，译法待决"}],"notes":[]}
